        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Cognitive Dissonance Infographic</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 20px;\n        background-color: #222;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        min-height: 100vh;\n        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .infographic {\n        width: 1200px;\n        height: 900px;\n        display: flex;\n        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n        overflow: hidden;\n        background-color: #fff;\n    }\n    \n    /* Left Panel */\n    .left-panel {\n        width: 38%;\n        background-color: #0d5c9e;\n        padding: 60px 40px 40px 40px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        color: white;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .header-text {\n        font-size: 22px;\n        line-height: 1.3;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    .main-title {\n        font-size: 56px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        line-height: 1.1;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    .subtitle {\n        font-size: 20px;\n        color: #38bdf8;\n        font-style: italic;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .heads-placeholder {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 160px;\n        margin-top: 50px;\n        background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n        border: 2px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        color: white;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .spacer {\n        flex-grow: 1;\n    }\n    .references {\n        font-size: 11px;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);\n    }\n    .ref-title {\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n\n    /* Right Panel */\n    .right-panel {\n        width: 62%;\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a4b8c 0%, #151b40 100%);\n        padding: 40px;\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n        grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n        gap: 15px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .card {\n        padding: 30px 25px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: row;\n        color: white;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .card:nth-child(odd) {\n        background-color: #245293;\n    }\n    .card:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #223d7d;\n    }\n    .card-content {\n        flex: 1;\n        padding-right: 15px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .card-title {\n        font-size: 24px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .card-text {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .card-icon-container {\n        width: 80px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .icon-placeholder {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 90px;\n        background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n        border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: white;\n        padding: 5px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .icon-cyan {\n        color: #38bdf8;\n        border-color: #38bdf8;\n        background-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.05);\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"infographic\">\n    <!-- Left Sidebar -->\n    <div class=\"left-panel\">\n        <div>\n            <div class=\"header-text\">The National Centre<br>for Neurology and Brain<br>Mechanics Presents</div>\n            <div class=\"main-title\">Cognitive<br>Dissonance:<br>Performing<br>Menial Tasks</div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">Study conducted by Jonas Festinger,<br>Marcus Carlsmith & Gabriel Chessman</div>\n            \n            <div class=\"heads-placeholder placeholder\">\n                [Graphic: Three white head silhouettes containing a gear, an exclamation mark, and a question mark]\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"references\">\n            <div class=\"ref-title\">REFERENCES:</div>\n            Walsh, Karen., Kemputo, Odelle., \"The psychology of self-deception\"<br>\n            The Anaptic Journal, 2017 • Satuda, Evelyn., Temitope, Anya., \"Neuroscience<br>\n            of Decision-Making\" The Science Review, 2018 • Brahms, Hansen., Leigh,<br>\n            Anderson., \"The Need and Neurology for Happiness\", The Arch Journal, 2020\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- Right Main Content -->\n    <div class=\"right-panel\">\n        \n        <!-- Card 1 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"card-content\">\n                <div class=\"card-title\">Purpose:</div>\n                <div class=\"card-text\">Festinger, Carlsmith and Chessman wanted to understand if making people perform a menial task would result in cognitive dissonance as a result of forced compliance behavior.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                <div class=\"icon-placeholder icon-cyan placeholder\">\n                    [Icon: Cyan gears and people silhouettes]\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Card 2 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"card-content\">\n                <div class=\"card-title\">Hypothesis:</div>\n                <div class=\"card-text\">When asked to do an unenjoyable task, people will not readily admit as much, and tell themselves and others it is actually enjoyable.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                <div class=\"icon-placeholder placeholder\">\n                    [Icon: White thumbs up and balance scale]\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Card 3 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"card-content\">\n                <div class=\"card-title\">Participants:</div>\n                <div class=\"card-text\">In a lab setting, 71 male students as participants to perform a series of menial tasks (like turning pegs in a peg board for an hour).</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                <div class=\"icon-placeholder placeholder\">\n                    [Icon: White clock and pegboard]\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Card 4 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"card-content\">\n                <div class=\"card-title\">Method:</div>\n                <div class=\"card-text\">The participants were then paid either $1 or $20 to tell a waiting participant (a test confederate) that the tasks were really engaging and fun. Almost all of the participants agreed to walk into the waiting room and persuade the confederate that the boring experiment would be interesting.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                <div class=\"icon-placeholder icon-cyan placeholder\">\n                    [Icon: Cyan speech bubble and hand holding money]\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Card 5 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"card-content\">\n                <div class=\"card-title\">Results:</div>\n                <div class=\"card-text\">When the participants were asked to evaluate the experiment, the participants who were paid only $1 rated the tedious task as more fun and enjoyable than the participants who were paid $20 to lie.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                <div class=\"icon-placeholder icon-cyan placeholder\">\n                    [Icon: Cyan upward arrow and star with plus sign]\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Card 6 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"card-content\">\n                <div class=\"card-title\">Conclusion:</div>\n                <div class=\"card-text\">Getting paid $1 is not sufficient for lying, so those who were paid $1 experienced dissonance. These participants could only overcome that dissonance by coming to believe that the tasks really were interesting and enjoyable.<br><br>Being paid $20 provides a reason, therefore there is no dissonance.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                <div class=\"icon-placeholder placeholder\">\n                    [Icon: White hand stamping and head with gear]\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
